

# <type>(<optional scope>): <summary>
#
# Types (Conventional Commits; release-please picks the version from them):
#   feat:      new behaviour            -> minor bump (below 1.0), in CHANGELOG
#   fix:       bug fix                  -> patch bump, in CHANGELOG
#   perf:      faster, same behaviour   -> patch bump, in CHANGELOG
#   revert:    revert a commit          -> patch bump, in CHANGELOG
#   docs:      README, comments, ADRs   -> no release
#   refactor:  no behaviour change      -> no release
#   test:      tests only               -> no release
#   build:     Cargo.toml, dependencies -> no release
#   ci:        workflows                -> no release
#   style:     formatting               -> no release
#   chore:     anything else            -> no release
#
# Breaking change: add "!" (feat!: ...) or a "BREAKING CHANGE: ..." footer.
# Force the next version with a footer:  Release-As: 0.1.1
